     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the total project, 6 key activities can be distinguished: - 12 teachers at educational institution strengthened in environmental governance (counted as one)
- Research of linguistics in the Makaguaje language for the official recognition of their existence as indigenous people, supporting the application for the reservation.
